---
title: "Binary to Hex Converter — Coding.Tools"
description: "Convert binary numbers to hexadecimal, decimal, and octal instantly in your browser. Fast, private, and free to use."
toolTitle: "Binary to Hex"
toolDescription: "Enter a binary number and convert it to hexadecimal, decimal, and octal. Results appear instantly in your browser."
